  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Due to inert pair effect, the stability of +1 oxidation\r\n\r\nstate increases down the group. Thus, correct order of stability is $\\mathrm{Al}  < \\mathrm{Ga} < \\mathrm{In} < \\mathrm{Tl}$"
  }
